  "weekly_summary": {
    "week": "2026-W45",
    "items": [
      {
        "order": 1,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周薪传有一场281人参加的超级RCQ，最终由黑掘坟（备牌带[[card:Chain of Smog|连锁烟雾]]组合技）席卷。",
          "en": "The 281-player Legacy RC Super Qualifier went to Mono-Black Reanimator with the [[card:Chain of Smog|Chain of Smog]] combo in the sideboard."
        },
        "deck_links": []
      },
      {
        "order": 2,
        "text": {
          "zh": "本周蓝黑霍佳葛继续优异表现：deck:94571ee332a1443ca413。这套牌现在和传统蓝黑节奏一起放在蓝黑节奏大类中，在详细统计页面可以看到小类别的详细数据。如果之后持续分庭抗礼会考虑将大类分开统计。这套牌在上周的北美EW上就已经打出了超过60%的胜率（EW的详细数据可以在“实体大赛”标签页中查看）。[[card:Dark Matter Manipulator|暗物质操弄师]]和[[card:Stitcher's Supplier|拼接师备尸]]给霍佳葛填坟，[[card:Moonshadow|蔽月影]]也能从同一套自磨组件中受益，同时保留了[[card:Force of Will|意志之力]]、[[card:Daze|目眩]]等蓝色节奏组件。",
          "en": "Dimir Hogaak kept putting up results this week, winning a Challenge with deck:94571ee332a1443ca413. It is grouped with traditional Dimir Tempo under the same parent archetype, and the detailed statistics show the two builds separately. If both continue to post comparable results, we may give them separate categories. Dimir Hogaak already won more than 60% of its matches at last week’s North American Eternal Weekend. Those results are in the Tabletop Major Events tab. [[card:Dark Matter Manipulator|Dark Matter Manipulator]] and [[card:Stitcher's Supplier|Stitcher's Supplier]] fill the graveyard for Hogaak, Arisen Necropolis. [[card:Moonshadow|Moonshadow]] benefits from the same self-mill package, and the deck keeps blue tempo staples such as [[card:Force of Will|Force of Will]] and [[card:Daze|Daze]]."
        },
